  "operative_text": "Sec. 1 (amending A.R.S. 13-3102, subsec. G): {+2. A PERSON WHO IS IN A PUBLIC ESTABLISHMENT OR AT A PUBLIC EVENT AND WHO POSSESSES A VALID PERMIT ISSUED PURSUANT TO SECTION 13-3112. THIS PARAGRAPH DOES NOT:+}\nSec. 1 (amending A.R.S. 13-3102, subsec. G): {+(+}a{+) APPLY TO A PUBLIC ESTABLISHMENT OR PUBLIC EVENT THAT IS A SECURED FACILITY.+}\nSec. 1 (amending A.R.S. 13-3102, subsec. G): {+(+}b{+) APPLY TO THE LICENSED PREMISES OF ANY PUBLIC ESTABLISHMENT OR PUBLIC EVENT WITH A LICENSE ISSUED PURSUANT TO TITLE 4.+}\nSec. 1 (amending A.R.S. 13-3102, subsec. G): {+(+}e{+) APPLY TO AN EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTION AS DEFINED IN SECTION 13-2911.+}\nSec. 1 (amending A.R.S. 13-3102, subsec. G): {+(+}k{+) LIMIT, RESTRICT OR PROHIBIT THE RIGHTS OF A PRIVATE PROPERTY OWNER, PRIVATE TENANT, PRIVATE EMPLOYER OR PRIVATE BUSINESS ENTITY.+}\nSec. 1 (amending A.R.S. 13-3102, subsec. G): {+6. \"SECURED FACILITY\" MEANS EITHER OF THE FOLLOWING:+}"
}